Asylum Act (AsylA) (AsylA)
SR 142.31 — Asylum Act of 26 June 1998 (AsylA).
|

:NOTE [links:https://fedlex.data.admin.ch/eli/cc/1999/358]
English is not an official language of the Swiss Confederation. This translation is provided for information purposes only and has no legal force.
This English text is the consolidation of 1 April 2025. The binding German, French and Italian texts have since been consolidated to 12 June 2026, so this translation is behind current law.

:INFO
Preamble
The Federal Assembly of the Swiss Confederation,
based on Article 121 of the Federal Constitution,
and having considered the Federal Council Dispatch of 4 December 1995,
decrees:
|

:NOTE
SR 101
Amended by No I 1 of the FA of 1 Oct. 2010 on the Coordination of Asylum and Extradition Proceedings, in force since 1 Apr. 2011 (AS 2011 925; BBl 2010 1467).
BBl 1996 II 1

